1
00:00:00,124 --> 00:00:04,164
"Hey baby, wanna go look for houses
in neighborhoods with good schools"?

2
00:00:05,504 --> 00:00:09,044
Again, I'm sorry. With Howard
and Bernadette getting married...

3
00:00:09,258 --> 00:00:11,508
...l got caught up
in a little wedding fever.

4
00:00:11,719 --> 00:00:13,099
l take it back.

5
00:00:13,304 --> 00:00:16,804
(Penny:)You can't take something like that back.
What are we supposed to do now?

6
00:00:17,016 --> 00:00:22,686
(Leonard:)Okay, at some point, we'll look back
and this is going to be a funny story.

7
00:00:22,896 --> 00:00:25,146
(Leonard:)Why don't we just start
doing that now?

8
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:26,983
- You're kidding.
- No.

9
00:00:27,192 --> 00:00:30,942
(Leonard:)Hey, do you remember...

10
00:00:31,363 --> 00:00:36,283
(Leonard:)...that time when I proposed to you
in bed, heh?

11
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:39,500
(Leonard:)And you were all, like,
"What are you doing"?

12
00:00:41,498 --> 00:00:43,338
(Leonard:)That was so funny.

13
00:00:44,835 --> 00:00:47,005
(Leonard:)So funny.

14
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:51,630
- It's not funny.
- Just give it a minute.

15
00:00:53,427 --> 00:00:56,027
ls that a little smile I see there?

